1. Frontend Development Prompt

Build the FRONTEND ONLY for a Student Information Management System.


Technology:

- HTML5

- CSS3

- JavaScript

- Bootstrap 5


Create a modern, clean, responsive college student website.


Pages required:


1. Login Page

- Student Register Number

- Password

- Show/Hide Password

- Login button

- Forgot Password

- Link to Registration

- Form validation

- Error/success messages


2. Student Registration Page

Fields:

- Student Name

- Register Number

- Date of Birth

- Gender

- Email

- Phone Number

- Department

- Year

- Section

- Address

- City

- District

- State

- Pincode

- Parent Name

- Parent Phone

- Password

- Confirm Password


3. Student Dashboard

- Welcome message

- Student name

- Register number

- Department

- Year

- Profile summary

- View Profile

- Edit Profile

- Logout


4. Student Profile Page

Display:

- Personal information

- Academic information

- Contact information

- Parent/Guardian information

- Edit button

- Save/Update button


Requirements:

- Fully responsive for mobile, tablet and desktop

- Professional college-style UI

- Clean navigation

- Cards and dashboard layout

- Client-side form validation

- Password visibility toggle

- Loading states

- Success/error notifications

- Use semantic HTML

- Keep JavaScript separate from HTML

- Keep CSS separate from HTML


IMPORTANT:

Do not create the backend or database yet.

Use dummy/mock data and placeholder API URLs.

Create a clean frontend folder structure.